        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "The GIF is the vendored micrograph plus a magnified 20.64 µm inset that grows across 12 frames at 800×600. Canonical CV similarity is 88.4. The rendered-frame luminance KS is 0.147 against a 0.05 reference, so the inset changes the histogram; the frame is not a copy of the specimen and not a pure stripe chart. Commons still has no CC bitmap of this species (R3)." ;
